<speak>
<s>From <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news, this is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">09042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Two hundred and fifty people were killed in Lebanon hours after a ceasefire was announced — Israel launched more than one hundred airstrikes across Beirut, the Bekaa Valley, and the south in its largest single operation of the war.</s> <s>Washington confirmed it never included Lebanon in the truce terms, giving Israel diplomatic cover for the deadliest escalation yet.</s> <s>Iran's now threatening to exit the ceasefire entirely, and what was supposed to be an off-ramp has become the war's bloodiest day.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Twenty-seven million Indians voted today with empty cooking gas cylinders — a month of <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> closure has cut the country's LPG supply, making wartime shortages the central issue in state elections across Kerala, Assam, and Puducherry.</s> <s>Kerala alone has two million emigrants sending twenty-three billion dollars home from Gulf states each year, and that lifeline's under direct threat.</s> <s>This is the first democratic test of a wartime economy, and the results will tell us whether Modi's government can hold its base while the war reshapes daily life.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Trump is formally discussing withdrawal from NATO — the Iran war gave him his pretext after allied governments refused base access and naval patrols.</s> <s>Secretary General Rutte meets Trump this week with all thirty-two member states weighing their response, while Australia's foreign minister separately called Washington unpredictable and announced Canberra's diversifying its alliances toward Japan, the EU, and Southeast Asia.</s> <s>The post-war order that held for eighty years is now being dismantled not by its adversaries but by its architect.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Haiti's first election in a decade has been postponed with no new date — gang-controlled territory covering most of Port-au-Prince makes voter registration physically impossible.</s> <s>One point four million people, twelve percent of the population, remain displaced, and the country hasn't had an elected government since twenty-sixteen.</s> <s>The Caribbean's most populous nation is now a decade into governance without a democratic mandate, and there's no path back in sight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China brokered a de-escalation deal between Pakistan and Afghanistan after week-long trilateral talks in Xinjiang — the first diplomatic contact since Islamabad's February strikes against armed group hideouts severed bilateral ties.</s> <s>Pakistan demands visible and verifiable Afghan action against the TTP, but the Taliban government has no incentive to comply and no mechanism to enforce it.</s> <s>Beijing's expanding its role as South Asia's mediator, filling a vacuum Washington abandoned years ago.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Freedom of information requests revealed that BAE Systems and two other defence contractors sit on fifty-three advisory committees shaping academic departments at twenty-one British universities.</s> <s>These firms aren't just funding research — they're setting the strategic direction of what gets taught, while the Iran war drives their profits to record highs.</s> <s>The line between weapons manufacturer and academic institution in Britain is now a formality.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran rerouted shipping through the <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="streɪt əv hɔrˈmuːz">Strait of Hormuz</phoneme> hours into the ceasefire, citing sea mines, and effectively maintained the closure of the waterway that carries one-fifth of global oil.</s> <s>Tehran simultaneously published ten ceasefire demands including full sanctions relief and uranium enrichment rights — terms Washington called workable, with delegations set to meet in Islamabad on Friday.</s> <s>Brent crude held near ninety-eight dollars, and the brief promise of reopening has already evaporated.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Afreximbank signed a two point five billion dollar facility to expand Dangote Group's Nigerian refinery from six hundred and fifty thousand to one point four million barrels daily.</s> <s>The forty billion dollar expansion targets one hundred billion in annual revenue by twenty-thirty, which would make Dangote one of the world's twenty largest industrial groups.</s> <s>This is continent-scale industry built and financed entirely with African capital — the counter-narrative to decades of extractive foreign investment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hours after agreeing to a ceasefire with Tehran, Trump announced fifty percent tariffs on any country supplying Iran with weapons — a threat aimed squarely at Beijing.</s> <s>Courts blocked Trump's tariff authority back in February, and China's leverage over rare-earth minerals gives it a powerful countermove, with a planned May summit adding reason to hesitate.</s> <s>The ceasefire and the trade war are now a single instrument — military diplomacy in one hand, economic coercion in the other.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A three-year field trial using metagenomics found that chemical fertilizer activates soil genes releasing carbon as CO2, while organic fertilizer switches on genes that lock it underground.</s> <s>Agricultural soil holds more carbon than all the world's forests combined, making fertilizer choice one of the largest unrecognized levers in climate policy.</s> <s>The difference isn't just chemistry — it's which microbial networks the soil feeds, and that distinction has been invisible until now.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A fifteen hundred-person cohort study found that visceral fat drives type two diabetes risk in Hispanic Americans but not in Black Americans, pointing to an entirely unmapped second metabolic pathway.</s> <s>Standard BMI screening misses both groups, yet no major health body has adopted ethnicity-specific thresholds despite years of evidence that one-size-fits-all metrics fail.</s> <s>The gap between what researchers know about metabolic risk and what clinics actually measure keeps widening.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers cross-referenced forty-seven archaeological sites across the Levant and found that heavy stone axes vanished precisely when megaherbivores over a thousand kilograms went extinct, roughly two hundred thousand years ago.</s> <s>The team argues that losing giant prey forced early humans into a cognitive leap — inventing lighter, more complex tools to hunt smaller, faster animals.</s> <s>Whether necessity drove intelligence or intelligence was already emerging remains one of archaeology's deepest open questions.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Greece announced a ban on social media for children under fifteen, taking effect January twenty twenty-seven — Prime Minister Mitsotakis delivered the news, fittingly, on TikTok.</s> <s>Seventy-five percent of Greek children on social platforms are primary school age, and Mitsotakis has written to the EU Commission proposing a bloc-wide age limit of fifteen.</s> <s>Whether a national ban can hold when the platforms are global and the children are resourceful is a question Athens hasn't answered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Microsoft terminated VeraCrypt's developer account without warning or explanation, cutting off Windows updates for the most widely used open-source full-disk encryption tool in the world.</s> <s>Journalists, activists, and security professionals depend on VeraCrypt — one platform decision can cripple the primary tool people use to protect themselves from state surveillance.</s> <s>No appeal process has been offered, and no reason has been given.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Analysis of two point eight million Telegram messages found nearly twenty-five thousand users buying AI-generated abuse images for as little as five euros, with PayPal processing the payments.</s> <s>The bots strip clothing from real people's photos on demand, industrializing sexual abuse at a scale that manual moderation can't touch.</s> <s>Telegram remains unclassified under the EU's Digital Services Act — a designation that would force the platform to police content it has so far refused to moderate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Objective Development released Little Snitch for Linux — the first time the renowned macOS network monitor has crossed into another ecosystem.</s> <s>The tool shows every outgoing connection a machine makes and lets users block them individually, a capability Linux had the kernel primitives for but never wrapped in a usable interface.</s> <s>In an era where every application phones home, knowing exactly what your machine talks to isn't a luxury — it's a security baseline.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing from <phoneme alphabet="ipa" ph="zʊhd">zuhd</phoneme> news.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>